      "name": "Hong Kong West Kowloon Station",
      "lat": 22.3037,
      "lng": 114.1649,
      "note": "High-speed rail to Shenzhen (~15–20 min), Guangzhou (~47 min), and on to Beijing, Shanghai and 80+ mainland cities. Immigration for both sides is in the station; arrive 45 min early. Walk to Austin (Tuen Ma Line) or Kowloon (Tung Chung Line, Airport Express).",
      "hours": "Trains ~6:30 AM–11:00 PM."
